1
00:00:00,738 --> 00:00:04,568
...and if I stop talking about it
then I'm just...

2
00:00:05,409 --> 00:00:07,209
(Bernadette:)Just what?

3
00:00:07,745 --> 00:00:11,275
(Howard:)Just plain old Howard Wolowitz again.

4
00:00:12,082 --> 00:00:15,452
(Howard:)Plain old Howard Wolowitz
is the best guy I know.

5
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,580
- You're just saying that.
- No, I'm not.

6
00:00:18,822 --> 00:00:22,382
(Bernadette:)I married him. On purpose.

7
00:00:23,761 --> 00:00:25,231
(Bernadette:)Come here.

8
00:00:25,896 --> 00:00:28,886
- I love you.
- I love you too.

9
00:00:35,472 --> 00:00:38,412
(Penny(emerging from Tardis):)Nothing to see here,
just sexy police business.

10
00:00:40,277 --> 00:00:42,937
(Leonard:)Just explaining the theory of relativity.

11
00:00:43,414 --> 00:00:44,434
(Bernadette:)Twice.

12
00:00:51,188 --> 00:00:52,558
(Bernadette:)Hey, what you watching?

13
00:00:52,756 --> 00:00:57,246
(Howard:)I don't know.
Raj sent me some video of Buzz Aldrin.

14
00:00:57,761 --> 00:01:01,991
(Buzz(on video, handing Halloween candy to children):)Here you go, it's a Milky Way.

15
00:01:02,199 --> 00:01:05,639
The Milky Way is a galaxy in space.

16
00:01:06,070 --> 00:01:08,630
(Buzz(on video, handing Halloween candy to children):)I've been in space.

17
00:01:11,075 --> 00:01:13,375
(Buzz(on video, handing Halloween candy to children):)Here's a Mars bar.

18
00:01:14,044 --> 00:01:16,204
(Buzz(on video, handing Halloween candy to children):)I'm an astronaut.

19
00:01:20,417 --> 00:01:22,747
And this one's a MoonPie.

20
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:25,550
(Buzz(on video, handing Halloween candy to children):)I walked on the Moon.

21
00:01:26,790 --> 00:01:28,120
(Buzz(on video, handing Halloween candy to children):)What have you done?

22
00:01:32,329 --> 00:01:34,459
(Howard:)Okay, I get it.

